      "id": "consult-email-send-gate",
      "fleet": "consultancies",
      "summary": "Pre-send email gate: suppression always wins, permission state, tenant, SPF/DKIM/DMARC records, one-click unsubscribe, accessible rendering, content-bound human authorization; never sends.",
